msgid "App Recognition & Statistics"
msgstr "应用识别与统计"

msgid "Precise mode (recommended)"
msgstr "精准模式（推荐）"

msgid "Locks DNS egress to this router so apps cannot bypass recognition via built-in HTTPDNS/DoH/DoT; counts usage time only when a window has real traffic (idle keep-alives ignored); expires DNS-to-app mapping in 30 minutes to avoid stale CDN attribution; suspends hardware flow offload while enabled so traffic counters stay complete (restored on disable)."
msgstr "锁定 DNS 出口到本路由器，防止应用通过内置 HTTPDNS/DoH/DoT 绕过识别；仅在窗口内有真实流量时才计使用时长（锁屏保活不计）；DNS 与应用映射 30 分钟过期，避免 CDN 复用后仍误归属；开启期间挂起硬件流量卸载以保证计数完整（关闭后恢复）。"

msgid "Precise mode enabled. Hardware flow offload was suspended to keep counters complete."
msgstr "精准模式已开启。硬件流量卸载已挂起以保证计数完整。"

msgid "Precise mode disabled. Reverted to the lenient mode."
msgstr "精准模式已关闭，已恢复为宽松模式。"

msgid "App recognition can only be configured on the main AP."
msgstr "应用识别只能在主路由（CAP）上配置。"

msgid "Enable \"App Usage & Access Control\" on the Clients page first."
msgstr "请先在「设备」页开启「应用使用与访问控制」。"
